              ":answer/value": "$$\nM\u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1\\end{array}\\right],\n$$\n$\\,x=-3$ and $y=-1$"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a0fae440-177b-584c-badd-9e3b7a78240e",
